WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.458 --> 00:00:07.625
(whipping)

00:00:07.625 --> 00:00:08.955
(squeaking)

00:00:10.504 --> 00:00:11.885
- [Voiceover] This is a baby.

00:00:11.885 --> 00:00:14.741
Basically a human, but
smaller and always drunk.

00:00:14.741 --> 00:00:16.946
She has caught the eye of a boy baby.

00:00:16.946 --> 00:00:19.245
He has picked out a ball for her.

00:00:19.245 --> 00:00:22.147
Now they are having a moment
that will soon be forgotten,

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:23.483
because they're babies.

00:00:23.483 --> 00:00:25.561
None of them are sure where they are.

00:00:25.561 --> 00:00:26.965
Is it someone's birthday or something?

00:00:26.965 --> 00:00:28.521
Oh, it's for a photo shoot,

00:00:28.521 --> 00:00:31.365
the world's biggest baby photo shoot.

00:00:31.365 --> 00:00:34.030
Seriously? Don't parents have
enough pictures of their kids?

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:35.667
Parents are the worst, am I right?

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:38.453
Here is a baby being fed
lemons by his mother,

00:00:38.453 --> 00:00:40.566
so he can see how sour it is.

00:00:40.566 --> 00:00:44.351
Look how the mother is
smiling while the baby cries.

00:00:44.351 --> 00:00:47.311
You know, it's not actually
that bad outside the womb.

00:00:47.311 --> 00:00:50.283
Uh-oh, here's some new
babies to join the fun.

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:53.406
Watch out, this baby pooped
himself and couldn't care less.

00:00:53.406 --> 00:00:56.087
This baby is trying to
connect with another baby,

00:00:56.087 --> 00:00:58.351
but he felt their relationship
was moving too fast

00:00:58.351 --> 00:01:00.231
and now she is alone.

00:01:00.231 --> 00:01:03.587
This is when she realized the
Disney movies were all lies.

00:01:03.587 --> 00:01:05.792
This baby has found a friend to cry with,

00:01:05.792 --> 00:01:07.824
sometimes it helps to have a friend.

00:01:07.824 --> 00:01:09.229
Wish I had a friend.

00:01:09.229 --> 00:01:10.842
There is a woman touching the babies

00:01:10.842 --> 00:01:12.642
and taking their pictures.

00:01:12.642 --> 00:01:15.671
The babies seem to have
no say in any of this.

00:01:15.671 --> 00:01:16.567
Out of boredom,

00:01:16.567 --> 00:01:18.771
these babies have started
their own fight club.

00:01:18.771 --> 00:01:21.325
Here's a baby trying
to escape the ball pit,

00:01:21.325 --> 00:01:23.682
silly baby, there is no escape.

00:01:23.682 --> 00:01:26.004
This prodigy is getting a
head start with Snapchat,

00:01:26.004 --> 00:01:28.290
has created a new filter with her mouth.

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:30.427
And another baby afraid of commitment,

00:01:30.427 --> 00:01:32.087
that's a bad baby.

00:01:32.087 --> 00:01:34.246
Bad babies get fed lemons.

00:01:34.246 --> 00:01:36.800
There are so many babies in the room now.

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:39.319
Oh finally, this must mean
it's time to take the picture.

00:01:39.319 --> 00:01:41.304
Say cheese little ones!

00:01:41.304 --> 00:01:42.842
Cheese!

00:01:42.842 --> 00:01:44.358
(picture snaps)

00:01:44.769 --> 00:01:46.649
Wait are, are any of the
babies looking at the camera?

00:01:46.649 --> 00:01:48.925
What was the whole point of any of this?

00:01:48.925 --> 00:01:51.270
In any case, we're gonna
reward them anyway.

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:53.272
Here are some bubbles.

00:01:53.272 --> 00:01:56.390
Soothing, calming bubbles.

00:01:56.390 --> 00:01:58.329
Aah, oh,

00:01:58.329 --> 00:02:00.813
well, I guess it doesn't
work for everyone.

00:02:00.813 --> 00:02:02.874
Now here's a montage of babies falling.

00:02:02.874 --> 00:02:07.106
(old time piano music)

00:02:19.638 --> 00:02:20.770
(whipping)

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:21.879
(squeaking)

